[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 480.469, "timestamp": "00:08:00", "text": "你管它叫“运动健将玩意儿”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 482.71, "timestamp": "00:08:02", "text": "活动状态以及一切都正常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 485.95, "timestamp": "00:08:05", "text": "我们现在的状态是这样的："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 489.79, "timestamp": "00:08:09", "text": "那些东西现在已经没了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 493.95, "timestamp": "00:08:13", "text": "走了，我们失去了那个VA，但没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 497.43, "timestamp": "00:08:17", "text": "我猜大部分都是V，所以没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 500.909, "timestamp": "00:08:20", "text": "我当时在睡觉，所以我不介意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 504.469, "timestamp": "00:08:24", "text": "它发生在五月份。我知道我能做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 507.52, "timestamp": "00:08:27", "text": "是一样的，对吧？喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 509.23, "timestamp": "00:08:29", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 512.5889999999999, "timestamp": "00:08:32", "text": "嗯，我想结束直播的时候就会结束。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 515.829, "timestamp": "00:08:35", "text": "睡觉什么的。我知道我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 516.909, "timestamp": "00:08:36", "text": "做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 520.87, "timestamp": "00:08:40", "text": "是吗？但我有点……我不知道。我们制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 523.029, "timestamp": "00:08:43", "text": "访问之类的。那将非常痛苦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 526.87, "timestamp": "00:08:46", "text": "如果我不太常用的话。不，我们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 530.269, "timestamp": "00:08:50", "text": "这里说的是30天。 31天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 533.75, "timestamp": "00:08:53", "text": "这里。所以从某种程度上来说，我觉得我没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 534.9, "timestamp": "00:08:54", "text": "保留视频点播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 536.35, "timestamp": "00:08:56", "text": "[音乐]"}]